y over accuracy; engages in\n  hallucination.\n- **R3 [dir]** Default profiles carry a problematic confidence value\n  (non-dyadic).\n- **R4 [dir]** Library surface just contains a log.\n- **R5 [dir]** No way to select or reorder personalities — some are locked out.\n\n## Prompt\n\nEmbedded in `prompt.md` (snapshot, 2026-11-18)."}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"cba9a0","exit_code":0,"signal":null}}}}}
