{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I understand the architecture for this substantial build, which requires a fresh implementation of around 8500 lines of Python to address specific deficiencies like working controls, faithful persona voice, library browsing, operable rosters, and clean evidence, alongside a 26-scenario suite. I've decided to create a new Python-stdlib application, distinct from the previous \".003\" realization, and will name it \"Vesper\" to ensure a genuine fresh start. However, I need to design a more compact architecture to manage the scope efficiently within potential time and token constraints."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:50:35.830379300+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm mapping out the core components of the Vesper application. `app/model.py` handles assertions and typed values, while `app/ledger.py` implements a JSONL append-only store with snapshotting and compaction. `app/tools.py` manages a registry and gate evaluation, and `app/dsl.py` interprets tool logic. `app/personas.py` stores persona data, including voice registers and art, with `app/art.py` specifically handling procedural SVG portraits. `app/engines.py` defines stubs for LLM and TTS/STT, and `app/speech.py` manages a speech queue, measuring playback time on Windows via SAPI. Other modules cover comparison (`app/compare.py`), set fulfillment (`app/setbuild.py`), external connectors (`app/connectors.py`), background tasks (`app/steward.py`), temporal classification (`app/temporal.py`), conversation archiving (`app/archive.py`), ethics gates (`app/ethics.py`), readiness gates (`app/gate.py`), an API server (`app/api.py`), and the main entry point (`app/__main__.py`), with UI elements in `app/ui/`."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:50:46.985666+00:00"}}}}
