{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm checking for local LLM availability, specifically Ollama, as GreyAvatar used it. If none is found, I'll use a stub that falls back to template responses. This stub will render retrieved source facts (like Wikipedia entries) in the persona's register, ensuring factual accuracy without invention, which satisfies the requirement for faithful voice and content preservation. I'll verify Python version, Ollama, and SAPI availability next."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:50:50.564038900+00:00"}}}}
