{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"With a live LLM available, persona responses can be generated directly, but the system prompt needs to constrain the register while preserving factual content from sources. I'll check for SAPI TTS availability via PowerShell. This is a large build, so I'm setting up a new architecture, tentatively named \"Vesper,\" with a \"Vesper Hub\" surface. The architecture will be compact, including components for booting, assertions, needs, registry, engine, personas, art, and connectors."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:51:01.987816+00:00"}}}}
