{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nThe UI's theme selector needs to actually restyle the application. My plan is to have the theme selector `<select>` element in the UI trigger a POST request to `/api/config`, which will then set the `ui:shell-theme` assertion on the server to apply the chosen theme."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:51:36.207330+00:00"}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"The build can now use a live LLM via Ollama's API, allowing personas to generate real responses. For better fidelity, persona system prompts should include register constraints and a rule to only use provided facts, flagging unsupported claims. I can also add a verification pass or ground answers in retrieved facts. I'll test SAPI via PowerShell for TTS and check Wikipedia connectivity."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:51:41.898168300+00:00"}}}}
