{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've confirmed that the Wikipedia API, SAPI TTS with two voices, and a local LLM are all functional. This means the build can incorporate live LLM, TTS, and Wikipedia data. I'm now planning the architecture, which will be extensive, and I've settled on the app name \"Vantage\" and port 9770. The design will draw from previous architectures but will be distinct due to prompt variations."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:51:48.859563500+00:00"}}}}
2026-11-23T08:51:49.652947Z  INFO session_db_call:session_db_job: chisel_agent::session_db: close time.busy=142µs time.idle=39.7µs
