ime under `version 0.3.0.001/runtime/`).\n- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n  `.devin/jev-cycle-001.out`; `user_opinion`/`user_commentary` filled at owner review\n  2026-11-19; convention: owner silence = agreement)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"criteria\": [\n    { \"name\": \"clean launch\", \"score\": 0.9, \"confidence\": 0.9, \"user_opinion\": 0.9 },"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"exec:0#1e364ee2037b488e80a730601dd0ee21","status":"in_progress","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"771:### Cycle 4 — 2026-11-23\n145:- **Result:** Built **Meridian** (`version 0.3.0.001/`) — a fresh, stdlib-only\n271:- **Result:** Built **Meridian `version 0.3.0.002/`** (baseline\n389:- **Result:** Built **Meridian `version 0.3.0.003/`** (baseline\n794:- **Result:** pending — build session running via `devin.exe acp`\n  unmet-need floor with template gates, candidates, deferral, grants;\n  chat-turn chain (decision-model intents → needs → drain → persona.speak);\n  persistent personalities with imitation marks; configurable steward thread;\n  projects + calendar; governed cleanup; exchange package import below\n  threshold; local web surface with honesty banner. Rectified shortcomings per\n  owner scope: bounded decision model for routing + respondent selection (A9),\n  tool-trust churn bounded rank adjustment (A5), configurable stewardship\n  duties (A3), command-center project/queue/focus view (A4), derived workshop\n  forms + assertion editing via Library (B-items), novice tool\n  validate/mint/inspect (A10), non-anthropomorphic respondent frame (A12),\n  independently-defined competing speech tools (A13), success-driven source\n  confidence adaptation (A8). Fleet install (A2/A11) and exchange media (A7)\n  not implemented, declared absent per scope ruling.\n  **Evidence:** `version 0.3.0.001/LAUNCH.md` + `launch.cmd`; launch logs\n  `version 0.3.0.001/evidence/launch/launch-*.log` +\n  `probe-20261119-005627.json` (clean launch: launched true, ok true, 68\n  components, live-ollama llama3.2, durable ledger); demo transcripts\n  `version 0.3.0.001/evidence/demos/01..11-*.md` + `INDEX.md`; manifest\n  `version 0.3.0.001/FEATURES.md`. Live instance left serving on\n  http://127.0.0.1:9760 (durable runtime under `version 0.3.0.001/runtime/`).\n- **Verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19; raw output\n  `.devin/jev-cycle-001.out`; `user_opinion`/`user_commentary` filled at owner review\n  2026-11-19; convention: owner silence = agreement)\n\n```json\n{\n  \"criteria\": [\n    { \"name\": \"clean launch\", \"score\": 0.9, \"confidence\": 0.9, \"user_opinion\": 0.9 },\n    { \"name\": \"existing features\", \"score\": 0.7, \"confidence\": 0.7, \"user_opinion\": 0.2 },\n    { \"name\": \"new features\", \"score\": 0.75, \"confidence\": 0.7, \"user_opinion\": 0 },\n    { \"name\": \"fleet install\", \"score\": 0, \"confidence\": 0.95, \"user_opinion\": 0 },\n    { \"name\": \"exchange media\", \"score\": 0, \"confidence\": 0.95, \"user_opinion\": 0 }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": 0.65,\n  \"judge_model\": \"SWE-2 Medium\",\n  \"user_commentary\": [\n    { \"criterion\": \"clean launch\", \"opinion\": 0.9, \"reasoning\": \"Interacted successfully; interface responsiveness mark\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\ndly better than prior runs.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"existing features\", \"opinion\": 0.2, \"reasoning\": \"JEV underestimated the capability of the previous\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\napplications; 0.2 is closer.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"new features\", \"opinion\": 0, \"reasoning\": \"No evidence of new features observed in the running appl\u001b[0mi\u001b[0m\ncation.\" },\n    { \"criterion\": \"user score\", \"opinion\": 0.25, \"reasoning\": \"Impressed with the independent build's similarity to th\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\n prior app; against it: all artificial voices speak over each other - a failure, and not even a capability that ought t\u001b[0mo\u001b[0m\n be specified; the lack of personality-unique generated art was a disappointment.\" }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Evidence is largely real, not self-asserted: launch logs, probe JSON, and per-demo transcripts contain actu\u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nl ledger rows consistent with runtime/demo/ledger.jsonl (223 rows, decision:* and need:* namespaces populated). Spot-ch\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\ncked decision.py (bounded feature-vector model + trust churn) and app.js (multi-tab UI functional but thin ~280 lines).\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\nDeductions: parity gaps vs GreyAvatar where LAN mirror, desktop shell, live connectors, soundscape/camera are declared \u001b[0ma\u001b[0m\nbsent; demo transcripts script-generated rather than interactive UI evidence; probe steward.runs=0 (steward responsiven\u001b[0me\u001b[0m\nss only partially evidenced). fleet/exchange-media correctly declared 0. No frontier-model escalation needed.\"\n}\n```\n\n- **Re-score verdict:** (JEV `devin -p`, SWE-2 Medium, 2026-11-19, under revised rubric —\n  `new features` removed, `completeness` + scenario suite added; raw output\n  `.devin/jev-rescore-meridian.out` incl. 13-area capability manifest;\n  `user_opinion`/`user_commentary` pending owner review; convention: owner silence =\n  agreement)"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec","cognition.ai/terminalPreview":true}}}}
