{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm defining the interpreter for my DSL in `dsl.py`, which handles operations like set, query, and assert. Expressions can resolve variables using \"$name\" paths into the environment, or interpolate strings with \"{name}\". The environment includes slots, query results, the loop variable `it`, and services like the ledger and engine. I'm also detailing the `grants` mechanism for issuing and consuming grants via an API, ensuring checks against the tool's grant scope."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:53:52.297567900+00:00"}}}}
