{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm using an SSE stream to monitor window presence. When all connected windows close, the server will shut down after a grace period. For theming, the server reads the `ui.shell-theme` configuration and applies it as a `data-theme` attribute to the `index.html`. The UI's JavaScript also applies the theme immediately upon selection changes and sends a POST request. I'll now proceed to write the `api.py` file, which is expected to be around 450 lines long."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T08:59:43.894055100+00:00"}}}}
