{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I'm structuring the UI files: index.html, styles.css, and app.js. The left rail needs persona portraits and reordering, while the theme selector must update both the `<html>` attribute and trigger API calls. Tabs include Chat, Inbox, Command, Library, Workshops, Exchange, Settings, and Log. The status bar will display sources, LLMs, gate, floor, needs, and version. I'll also implement the honesty banner, chat feed with composer and quick-select, a fullscreen button, and a settings modal for preloads, steward duties, response depth, and persona frame. The Library tab will feature browsable sections for Personalities, Tools, Packages, Artifacts, and Assertions."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:02:32.795694+00:00"}}}}
