{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"Okay, I'm mapping out `app.js`'s UI logic. The state polling and SSE for live cards seem straightforward. Roster rendering needs to handle portraits, active states, and selection/movement via API calls. The theme selector needs to apply the theme immediately and then update the config. Chat feed, tabs, inbox, command, library, workshops, exchange, settings, log viewer, editor modal, and fullscreen button all have specific API interactions or UI behaviors to implement. I'll start writing it now."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:03:16.696738500+00:00"}}}}
