ailures honestly rather than suppressing them.\n   - Generate launch logs and machine-readable evidence.\n   - Complete `devlog.md` Cycle 4 `Result:` with what was built, location, and evidence paths.\n   - Record Cycle 4 `Time to implement` with the session end time.\n   - Leave `Verdict:` pending for the separate JEV session.\n   - A separate JEV session must later evaluate the build and produce the required JSON verdict.\n\n   The todo state immediately before implementation was:\n\n   1. Scaffold `version 0.3.0.004/` — in progress\n   2. Core model + ledger — pending\n   3. Tools — pending\n   4. Personas — pending\n   5. Engines and supporting subsystems — pending\n   6. API and two-part boot — pending\n   7. UI fixes — pending\n   8. Seed packs, fixtures, scripts, docs — pending\n   9. Launch-check and scenario suite — pending\n   10. Fix failures and complete devlog — pending\n\n   The implementation had advanced through item 7 and partial item 8, but runtime evidence had not yet been generated or validated.\n\n8. Current Work:\n\n   Immediately before the summary request, the assistant had just finished removing the accidental blank-line doubling from the newly generated runtime and UI files. The latest tool output reported:\n\n   - `despaced app\\__main__.py 384 -> 165`\n   - `despaced app/ui\\app.js 1112 -> 526`\n   - `despaced app/ui\\index.html 348 -> 174`\n   - `despaced app/ui\\styles.css 250 -> 125`\n   - `ALL_COMPILE`\n\n   This means the generated application modules and UI were syntactically compiling after cleanup, but the launch/evidence/scenario phase had not started.\n\n   The most recent implementation files of interest are:\n\n   - `version 0.3.0.004/app/__main__.py`: 165 nonblank lines after cleanup; intended boot entry point.\n   - `version 0.3.0.004/app/api.py`: rewritten at message 116; intended HTTP/API/SSE/watchdog implementation.\n   - `version 0.3.0.004/app/ui/app.js`: 526 nonblank lines after cleanup; intended live theme, roster, Library, editor, chat, inbox, and control behavior.\n   - `version 0.3.0.004/app/ui/index.html`: 174 nonblank lines after cleanup.\n   - `version 0.3.0.004/app/ui/styles.css`: 125 nonblank lines after cleanup.\n\n   The application was not yet launched, the scenario suite had not yet run, no final launch artifacts were confirmed, and `devlog.md` still contained:\n\n   - `Time to implement: ... session end pending`\n   - `Result: pending — build session running via devin.exe acp`\n   - `Verdict: pending JEV`\n\n</summary>","sessionId":"flax-utensil"}}
