{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'm adding art generation to the minting process, ensuring `p[\"art\"]` is set before saving and that a `persona:art` assertion is made. The `art.generate` function returns the necessary details, and its output path is compatible with the persona save location. I'm also updating the `Ctx` initialization with an `exchange_schema` and refining how the `root` property is determined, favoring an attribute set in `__init__` over a computed property for clarity and robustness."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:16:47.325532700+00:00"}}}}
