{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've identified a timeout issue: the scenario reads 20 bytes, but the server sends only 8. Changing the scenario to `conn.read(8)` should resolve this. Separately, I'm seeing an issue where factual prompts are incorrectly marked as grounded even when no facts are retrieved. The code treats a lack of facts as a successful grounding check, which allows unsupported claims to pass unflagged."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:17:02.042462900+00:00"}}}}
