{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"flax-utensil","update":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_thought_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"I've found the issue: exporting and then immediately importing personas creates duplicates because the import handler re-mints existing personas. This is intended for cross-installation exchange, but within a single installation, it doubles the roster. The fix is to skip minting personas that already exist on the roster during an exchange import, logging them as duplicates instead."},"_meta":{"cognition.ai/timestamp":"2026-11-23T09:22:53.468928400+00:00"}}}}
